News of the World is a 2020 American Western film  co-written and directed by Paul Greengrass, based on the 2016 novel of the
same name by Paulette Jiles, and starring Tom Hanks and introducing Helena Zengel in her international film debut.

11
01:08:18,947 --> 01:08:24,947
The film follows an aging Civil War veteran who must return a young girl who was taken in
by the Kiowa, and raised as one of them, to her last remaining family.

12
01:14:31,578 --> 01:14:37,578
News of the World was released theatrically by Universal Pictures in the
United States on December 25, 2020, and grossed $12 million.

13
01:20:44,210 --> 01:20:50,210
Internationally, the film was released by Netflix in
other territories on February 10, 2021.

14
